<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="no">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>STRAFFEKONK 2026 – VM-sluttspillet</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@400;600;700&family=Barlow:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;}
:root{
  --green:#0a5c2e;--green3:#1a9e52;
  --gold:#f4c430;--gold2:#e8a800;
  --white:#fff;--text:#e8f0e8;--muted:#7a9a7a;
  --red:#e53e3e;--blue:#1e88e5;
  --card-bg:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  --card-border:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
}
body{
  background:#070b07;
  background-image:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%,rgba(10,92,46,0.45) 0%,transparent 60%);
  color:var(--text);font-family:'Barlow',sans-serif;min-height:100vh;overflow-x:hidden;
}
#app{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:14px;}
.screen{display:none;}
.screen.active{display:block;}
h1,h2{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;}

.vm-badge{display:inline-flex;gap:8px;background:var(--gold);color:#000;font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:3px;padding:5px 16px;border-radius:2px;text-transform:uppercase;}
.logo-title{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(44px,9vw,76px);font-weight:800;line-height:0.95;letter-spacing:-1px;color:var(--white);text-shadow:0 0 50px rgba(244,196,48,0.3);}
.logo-sub{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(20px,4vw,32px);font-weight:700;color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:6px;}
.muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;}

.btn-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--gold);color:#000;border:none;font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;padding:14px 36px;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;text-transform:uppercase;box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(244,196,48,0.4);transition:all 0.15s;}
.btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);}
.btn-primary:disabled{opacity:0.35;cursor:default;transform:none;box-shadow:none;}
.btn-secondary{background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--card-border);font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;padding:11px 24px;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;text-transform:uppercase;}
.btn-row{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:14px;}
.section-label{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;margin:16px 0 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
.section-label::after{content:'';flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--card-border);}

#introScreen{text-align:center;padding:24px 0;}
.count-grid{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;margin:22px 0;}
.count-btn{width:74px;height:74px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--card-bg);border:2px solid var(--card-border);color:var(--white);font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:30px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.15s;}
.count-btn:hover{border-color:var(--gold);transform:translateY(-2px);}
.count-btn small{display:block;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--muted);font-family:'Barlow',sans-serif;}
.keys-info{display:flex;gap:18px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px;}
.key-chip{background:var(--card-bg);border:1px solid var(--card-border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 16px;font-size:12px;}
.key-chip b{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;color:var(--gold);}

#pickHeader{text-align:center;margin-bottom:14px;}
.pick-turn{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;}
.team-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(108px,1fr));gap:8px;}
.team-card{background:var(--card-bg);border:1.5px solid var(--card-border);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 6px;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.12s;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
.team-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:4px;background:var(--kit,#555);}
.team-card:hover{border-color:var(--gold);transform:translateY(-2px);}
.team-card.taken{opacity:0.3;pointer-events:none;}
.team-card .tflag{font-size:26px;}
.team-card .tname{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-top:2px;}
.team-card .tstar{font-size:10px;color:var(--gold);margin-top:1px;}
.picked-row{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:12px 0;}
.picked-chip{background:rgba(244,196,48,0.1);border:1px solid var(--gold);border-radius:20px;padding:5px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;}

#groupScreen h2{text-align:center;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:4px;}
.group-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-top:14px;}
.group-box{background:var(--card-bg);border:1px solid var(--card-border);border-radius:8px;padding:10px;opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px);transition:all 0.35s;}
.group-box.reveal{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
.group-title{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:6px;}
.group-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;padding:3px 4px;border-radius:4px;}
.group-row .gpts{margin-left:auto;font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);}
.group-row.qualified{background:rgba(26,158,82,0.18);}
.group-row.qualified .gpts{color:var(--green3);font-weight:700;}
.group-row.human-team{outline:1px solid var(--gold);}

#bracketScreen h2{text-align:center;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:2px;}
.bracket-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:14px;align-items:center;}
.round-col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;justify-content:space-around;height:100%;}
.round-title{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase;}
.bmatch{background:var(--card-bg);border:1px solid var(--card-border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;font-size:12px;}
.bmatch.next-human{border-color:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(244,196,48,0.3);}
.brow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:5px 8px;border-left:3px solid var(--kit,transparent);}
.brow+.brow{border-top:1px solid var(--card-border);}
.brow .bflag{font-size:15px;}
.brow .bname{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.5px;font-size:11px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;}
.brow .bscore{margin-left:auto;font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);}
.brow.winner{background:rgba(244,196,48,0.12);}
.brow.winner .bname,.brow.winner .bscore{color:var(--gold);}
.brow.loser{opacity:0.45;}
.you-marker{font-size:9px;background:var(--gold);color:#000;border-radius:3px;padding:0 4px;font-weight:800;}

#matchIntro{text-align:center;}
.vs-card{background:var(--card-bg);border:1px solid var(--card-border);border-radius:16px;padding:26px;margin:14px 0;}
.vs-line{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:20px;}
.vs-team{text-align:center;flex:1;max-width:200px;}
.vs-team .vflag{font-size:52px;}
.vs-team .vname{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:4px;}
.vs-team .vstar{font-size:12px;color:var(--gold);margin-top:2px;}
.vs-team .vctrl{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px;}
.kit-swatch{display:inline-flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px;}
.kit-swatch span{width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);display:inline-block;}
.vs-x{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:var(--gold);}

/* ===== PENALTY ===== */
#penaltyScreen{user-select:none;}
.pen-scoreboard{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:var(--card-bg);border:1px solid var(--card-border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 14px;margin-bottom:10px;gap:8px;}
.pen-team{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;}
.pen-team.right{justify-content:flex-end;}
.pen-team .pflag{font-size:24px;}
.pen-team .pname{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px;padding:1px 7px;border-radius:4px;color:#fff;}
.pen-dots{display:flex;gap:4px;}
.pdot{width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border:1px solid var(--card-border);font-size:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}
.pdot.goal{background:var(--green3);border-color:var(--green3);}
.pdot.miss{background:var(--red);border-color:var(--red);}
.pen-status{
  text-align:center;font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;
  letter-spacing:1px;background:var(--card-bg);border:1px solid var(--card-border);
  border-radius:8px;padding:9px;margin-bottom:10px;min-height:40px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;
}
.pen-status.goal-flash{background:rgba(26,158,82,0.25);border-color:var(--green3);color:#7be3a8;}
.pen-status.save-flash{background:rgba(229,62,62,0.22);border-color:var(--red);color:#fc9b9b;}
.pen-status.choosing{animation:pulseGold 0.8s ease-in-out infinite;border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold);}
@keyframes pulseGold{50%{background:rgba(244,196,48,0.14);}}

.count-track{height:7px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:10px;}
.count-fill{height:100%;background:var(--gold);border-radius:4px;width:100%;transition:width 0.08s linear;}

#arena{
  position:relative;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;
  border:1px solid var(--card-border);
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0d1410 0%,#0e2416 38%,#155c30 39%,#0f4a26 100%);
  margin-bottom:10px;
}
#arena svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;}
.ready-chip{
  position:absolute;top:8px;font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;
  letter-spacing:1px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
  border:2px solid var(--chip,#444);color:#ddd;transition:all 0.15s;z-index:5;
}
.ready-chip.left{left:8px;}
.ready-chip.right{right:8px;}
.ready-chip.ready{background:var(--green3);color:#fff;border-color:var(--green3);}

/* keeper-animasjoner */
#keeperG{transform-origin:300px 208px;}
#keeperG.dive-left{animation:diveL 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.3,1.3,0.6,1) forwards;}
#keeperG.dive-right{animation:diveR 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.3,1.3,0.6,1) forwards;}
#keeperG.dive-center{animation:diveC 0.45s ease-out forwards;}
@keyframes diveL{to{transform:translate(-118px,-26px) rotate(-58deg);}}
@keyframes diveR{to{transform:translate(118px,-26px) rotate(58deg);}}
@keyframes diveC{50%{transform:translateY(-28px);}to{transform:translateY(-8px);}}
#keeperBody.celebrate{animation:kJoy 0.4s ease-in-out 3;}
@keyframes kJoy{50%{transform:translateY(-7px);}}

/* skytter-animasjoner */
#shooterG{transform-origin:252px 300px;}
#shooterG.run{animation:runUp 0.42s ease-in forwards;}
@keyframes runUp{0%{transform:translate(0,0);}50%{transform:translate(20px,4px) rotate(2deg);}100%{transform:translate(38px,10px) rotate(6deg);}}
#shooterG.celebrate{animation:celebJump 0.45s ease-out 3;}
@keyframes celebJump{0%{transform:translate(38px,10px);}50%{transform:translate(38px,-16px);}100%{transform:translate(38px,10px);}}
#shooterG.sad{animation:droop 0.6s ease-out forwards;}
@keyframes droop{to{transform:translate(38px,14px) rotate(-6deg);}}

/* ball-animasjoner */
#ballG{transform-origin:300px 330px;}
#ballG.shoot-left{animation:shootL 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.4,1) forwards;}
#ballG.shoot-center{animation:shootC 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.4,1) forwards;}
#ballG.shoot-right{animation:shootR 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.4,1) forwards;}
#ballG.shoot-over{animation:shootOver 0.6s ease-out forwards;}
#ballG.caught-left{animation:caughtL 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.4,1) forwards;}
#ballG.caught-center{animation:caughtC 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.4,1) forwards;}
#ballG.caught-right{animation:caughtR 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.4,1) forwards;}
@keyframes shootL{to{transform:translate(-150px,-178px) scale(0.55);}}
@keyframes shootC{to{transform:translate(0,-182px) scale(0.55);}}
@keyframes shootR{to{transform:translate(150px,-178px) scale(0.55);}}
@keyframes shootOver{to{transform:translate(30px,-300px) scale(0.35);opacity:0.4;}}
@keyframes caughtL{to{transform:translate(-112px,-136px) scale(0.5);}}
@keyframes caughtC{to{transform:translate(0,-138px) scale(0.5);}}
@keyframes caughtR{to{transform:translate(112px,-136px) scale(0.5);}}

#netG.ripple{animation:netRipple 0.45s ease-out;}
@keyframes netRipple{30%{transform:translateY(5px) skewX(2deg);}60%{transform:translateY(-2px);}100%{transform:none;}}
.flash-light{animation:flash 0.5s ease-out 2;}
@keyframes flash{50%{opacity:1;}}

/* publikum */
#crowdG circle{transform-box:fill-box;transform-origin:center;}
#crowdG.jump circle{animation:cjump 0.28s ease-in-out 4 alternate;}
@keyframes cjump{to{transform:translateY(-5px);}}
#crowdG circle:nth-child(2n){animation-delay:0.08s;}
#crowdG circle:nth-child(3n){animation-delay:0.15s;}

/* emoji-burst over arenaen */
.emoji-pop{position:absolute;font-size:24px;animation:epop 1.15s ease-out forwards;pointer-events:none;z-index:6;}
@keyframes epop{from{transform:translateY(0) scale(0.6);opacity:1;}to{transform:translateY(-80px) scale(1.4);opacity:0;}}

.touch-rows{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;}
.touch-side{border-radius:10px;padding:8px;border:2px solid var(--tkit,transparent);}
.touch-side.inactive{opacity:0.25;pointer-events:none;}
.touch-label{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--text);}
.touch-btns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:6px;}
.tbtn{background:var(--card-bg);border:1.5px solid var(--card-border);border-radius:8px;padding:13px 4px;color:var(--text);font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;letter-spacing:0.5px;}
.tbtn:active{transform:scale(0.95);background:rgba(244,196,48,0.15);}

.sim-line{background:var(--card-bg);border:1px solid var(--card-border);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 14px;margin-bottom:7px;font-size:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;opacity:0;transform:translateX(-8px);transition:all 0.3s;}
.sim-line.reveal{opacity:1;transform:none;}
.sim-line .sw{color:var(--gold);font-weight:700;}

#championScreen{text-align:center;padding:20px 0;}
.champ-trophy{font-size:96px;animation:float 3s ease-in-out infinite;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 30px rgba(244,196,48,0.7));}
@keyframes float{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}50%{transform:translateY(-12px);}}
.champ-flag{font-size:64px;margin:8px 0;}
.champ-title{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:38px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--gold);}
.champ-sub{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px;}

.confetti-piece{position:fixed;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;animation:confettiFall linear forwards;pointer-events:none;z-index:200;}
@keyframes confettiFall{0%{transform:translateY(-20px) rotate(0);opacity:1;}100%{transform:translateY(110vh) rotate(720deg);opacity:0;}}

.big-banner{
  position:fixed;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column;
  background:rgba(0,0,0,0.72);z-index:100;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;transition:opacity 0.25s;
}
.big-banner.show{opacity:1;}
.bb-text{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(50px,13vw,92px);font-weight:800;color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:-1px;text-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(244,196,48,0.8);animation:bbPop 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1);}
.bb-text.save{color:#ff8a80;text-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(229,62,62,0.8);}
.bb-sub{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:var(--white);letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:8px;}
@keyframes bbPop{from{transform:scale(0.5);opacity:0;}to{transform:scale(1);opacity:1;}}

@media (max-width:560px){
  .bracket-wrap{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="app">

<div id="introScreen" class="screen active">
  <div style="text-align:center;">
    <div class="vm-badge">⚽ VM 2026 · USA · CANADA · MEXICO ⚽</div>
    <div style="margin:18px 0 4px;" class="logo-title">STRAFFEKONK</div>
    <div class="logo-sub">VM-SLUTTSPILLET</div>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width:460px;margin:16px auto;">48 lag. Ett gruppespill. 16 går videre til VM-sluttspillet – og alt avgjøres fra ellevemeteren. Velg lag, les motstanderen, og vær iskald fra straffemerket.</p>
    <div class="section-label" style="max-width:300px;margin:18px auto 6px;">Hvor mange spillere?</div>
    <div class="count-grid">
      <button class="count-btn" onclick="setPlayers(1)">1<small>SPILLER</small></button>
      <button class="count-btn" onclick="setPlayers(2)">2<small>SPILLERE</small></button>
      <button class="count-btn" onclick="setPlayers(3)">3<small>SPILLERE</small></button>
      <button class="count-btn" onclick="setPlayers(4)">4<small>SPILLERE</small></button>
    </div>
    <div class="keys-info">
      <div class="key-chip">Venstre side: <b>A · W · D</b></div>
      <div class="key-chip">Høyre side: <b>← · ↑ · →</b></div>
      <div class="key-chip">iPad: <b>Trykk på sonene</b></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="pickScreen" class="screen">
  <div id="pickHeader">
    <div class="vm-badge">VELG LAG</div>
    <div class="pick-turn" id="pickTurn">Spiller 1 velger lag</div>
    <div class="picked-row" id="pickedRow"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="team-grid" id="teamGrid"></div>
</div>

<div id="groupScreen" class="screen">
  <div style="text-align:center;"><div class="vm-badge">GRUPPESPILLET</div></div>
  <h2 style="margin-top:10px;">48 LAG · 12 GRUPPER</h2>
  <p class="muted" style="text-align:center;">Gruppevinnerne og de fire beste toerne går videre til VM-sluttspillet.</p>
  <div class="group-grid" id="groupGrid"></div>
  <div class="btn-row"><button class="btn-primary" id="toBracketBtn" onclick="showBracket()" disabled>VM-SLUTTSPILLET →</button></div>
</div>

<div id="bracketScreen" class="screen">
  <div style="text-align:center;"><div class="vm-badge">VM-SLUTTSPILLET</div></div>
  <h2 style="margin-top:10px;" id="bracketTitle">ÅTTEDELSFINALER</h2>
  <div class="bracket-wrap" id="bracketWrap"></div>
  <div id="simFeed" style="margin-top:12px;"></div>
  <div class="btn-row"><button class="btn-primary" id="bracketNextBtn" onclick="bracketNext()">Neste kamp →</button></div>
</div>

<div id="matchIntro" class="screen">
  <div style="text-align:center;"><div class="vm-badge" id="miRound">ÅTTEDELSFINALE</div></div>
  <div class="vs-card">
    <div class="vs-line">
      <div class="vs-team">
        <div class="vflag" id="miFlagA"></div>
        <div class="vname" id="miNameA"></div>
        <div class="vstar" id="miStarA"></div>
        <div class="kit-swatch" id="miKitA"></div>
        <div class="vctrl" id="miCtrlA"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="vs-x">VS</div>
      <div class="vs-team">
        <div class="vflag" id="miFlagB"></div>
        <div class="vname" id="miNameB"></div>
        <div class="vstar" id="miStarB"></div>
        <div class="kit-swatch" id="miKitB"></div>
        <div class="vctrl" id="miCtrlB"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="muted" style="margin-top:16px;">Best av tre straffer. Likt etter tre? <strong style="color:var(--gold);">Sudden death.</strong><br>Skytter og keeper velger hjørne i skjul – samtidig!</p>
  </div>
  <div class="btn-row"><button class="btn-primary" onclick="beginPenalties()">⚽ Til ellevemeteren</button></div>
</div>

<div id="penaltyScreen" class="screen">
  <div class="pen-scoreboard">
